              "value": "<p data-syno-attrs=\"{&quot;textMarks&quot;:[{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_size&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;14pt&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_family&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Golos&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;em&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;strong&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;#080809&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;background_color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;#ffffff&quot;}]}\" pm-open-left=\"1\"><b>Определите формат:</b></p><p data-syno-attrs=\"{&quot;textMarks&quot;:[{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_size&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;14pt&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_family&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Golos&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;em&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;strong&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;#080809&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;background_color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;#ffffff&quot;}]}\">«Дай ответ в виде списка с примерами».</p>",
